The '''Daily Blitz Stages''' are a group of stages that are a harder version of the regular [[:Category:Daily Stages|Daily Stages]]. These stages do have a few differences though.
* They appear at a specific time (8am - 9am, 12pm - 1pm, 7pm - 8pm)
* The level only spawns one type of enemy. (like Floating enemies in the Monday Hard+ stage)
** The enemy variant also corresponds to the variant in the day's Catfruit stage

* The chance that you'll get the item is double compared to the Hard version.
* For stages that already give you the item after beating the regular stage you'll get two of the same item.

== Stages ==
*[[Rich Cat (Veteran)|Monday Blitz Stage]] (Floating) - (Rich Cat)

*[[Speed Cat (Veteran)|Tuesday Blitz Stage]] (Dark) - (Speed Up x2)

*[[Cat Jobs (Veteran)|Wednesday Blitz Stage]] (Red) - (Cat Jobs)

*[[Sniper Cat (Veteran)|Thursday Blitz Stage]] (Alien) - (Sniper Cat)

*[[Helpful Cat (Veteran)|Friday Blitz Stage]] (Angel) - (Cat CPU x2)
